      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-20T22:36:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Malloc failure returns -1, while SPI failures return `EGIS_BEP_RESULT_IO_ERROR`. It would be better to return `EGIS_BEP_RESULT_NO_MEMORY` for allocation failures",
